        <item>
            <title>1.2.13</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:21:43 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.2.13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.13</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Left ⌘⌥ shortcuts no longer start a text capture

Tapping right ⌘ and right ⌥ together captures text off the screen. Left ⌘
and left ⌥ counted too, so a global shortcut like ⌘⌥X in another app
started a text capture almost every time: that app takes the X before Cubby
can see it, and Cubby saw only ⌘⌥ tapped. Now only the right-hand keys count.

Tapping right ⌘ while holding left ⌘ now opens the panel, and the same goes
for right ⌥. Before, that tap was missed.
]]></description>
